  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#19171c\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/454/277/animaloriginsbanner4.png\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pehkui\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/453/204/68747470733a2f2f63646e2e646973636f72646170702e636f.png\" alt=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pehkui\" width=\"268\" height=\"90\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/origins\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/453/205/68747470733a2f2f6d656469612e646973636f72646170702e.png\" alt=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/origins\" width=\"269\" height=\"91\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/453/206/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4f6c315463.png\" alt=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" width=\"268\" height=\"90\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/origins-infinite\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看为此模组包制作的原版模组！</a></span><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">當前起源：</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/453/208/penguindescription.jpg\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/453/209/reptiliandescription.jpg\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/453/248/kangaroodescription.jpg\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/454/249/roadrunnerdescription.jpg\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/454/250/chameleondescription.jpg\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></span><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/454/254/monkeydescription.jpg\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>注意：</strong>起源卡片略微过时，以下是部分更改：</span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\">企鵝：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">增強：移除了魚素主義特徵</span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\">袋鼠：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">修復：修正了強壯雙腿在奔跑時而非潛行時生效的問題</span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\">变色龙：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">增強：移除了新鮮空氣</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">重做：变色龙現在體型更小</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">增強：跑步和攀爬速度更快</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">重做：隱形現在會顯示玩家的影子以方便發現他們</span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\">爬行類：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">增強：現在任何皮革物品都能防止凍結</span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\">猴子：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">增強：耐力應該持續更久且恢復更快</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">卡片將很快更新。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在最近的更新中，变色龙起源再次進行了重做。如果在多人遊戲中仍然無法正常工作，隱形功能將被完全重做。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\">感謝<strong>BLIPS</strong>為快嘴鳥起源做出的貢獻。</span><span><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/454/356/questions.png\" width=\"549\" height=\"252\"><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fscalacube.com%252fp%252f_hosting_server_minecraft%252f3837999\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://scalacube.com/images/banners/modpack.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"176\"></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
